<title>FRANCE: Alcatel rises on first quarter sales.</title>
<headline>Alcatel rises on first quarter sales.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Alcatel Alsthom SA gained over four percent on Tuesday morning on the back of a 12.1 percent rise in its first quarter sales.</p>
<p>At 0829 GMT, the share was up 4.34 percent at 673 francs. While sales were up, new orders were slightly down. All sectors contributed to the sales rise apart from the batteries sector.</p>
</text>
